{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a0a9a1-438a-722c-9ea8-a4ca2fc4145c","session_id":"01a0a9a1-0884-7083-ab3b-7bcef8753b24","message":{"id":"01a0a9a1438a722c9ea8a4c9c199572e","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## pnpm 默认存储位置\n\n根据 pnpm 官方文档,**默认**情况下,store 目录按以下顺序解析:\n\n| 优先级 | 条件 | 默认路径 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 设置了 `$PNPM_HOME` 环境变量 | `$PNPM_HOME/store` |\n| 2 | 设置了 `$XDG_DATA_HOME` 环境变量(Linux) | `$XDG_DATA_HOME/pnpm/store` |\n| 3 | Windows | `~/AppData/Local/pnpm/store` |\n| 4 | macOS | `~/Library/pnpm/store` |\n| 5 | Linux(无上述变量时) | `~/.local/share/pnpm/store` |\n\n补充说明:\n- store 应与安装目录位于**同一磁盘**,否则会创建多个 store(每个驱动器/文件系统一个)。\n- 可通过 `pnpm store path` 命令查看当前生效的 store 路径。\n- 可通过 `pnpm config set store-dir<path>` 自定义。\n\n## 引用\n\n主要来源 — https://pnpm.io/settings/store(pnpm 官方文档,Store & Lockfile Settings页面)\n\n其他参考:\n- https://pnpm.io/10.x/configuring(说明未配置时 pnpm 会自动在与项目同一驱动器创建 store)\n- https://pnpm.io/cli/store(`pnpm store path` 命令文档)"}],"model":"fast-model","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":42714,"output_tokens":318,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10043,"cache_read_input_tokens":32671,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a0a9a10a3f7314bb6e1bc1260a1b98","_messageId":"01a0a9a1438a722c9ea8a4c9c199572e","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a0a9a10a3f7314bb6e1bc1260a1b98","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a0a9a1438a722c9ea8a4c9c199572e","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a0a9a1438a722c9ea8a4c9c199572e","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a0a9a1-438a-722c-9ea8-a4ca2fc4145c","traceparent":"00-fee1a3cff2be1ae00603a614d3f4e84e-653a82477c4fd1b6-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a0a9a1-0884-7083-ab3b-7bcef8753b24,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a0a9a10a3f7314bb6e1bc1260a1b98"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-16T09:51:57.425Z"}
